t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tFact Sheets\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-link is-current\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"Releases\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tReleases\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-link\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/remarks/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"Remarks\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRemarks\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-link\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/research/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"Research\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tResearch\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</nav>\n\t</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Last night, President Donald J. Trump sat down with <em>60 Minutes</em> following the midterm elections and made a powerful case for his America First record.</strong> President Trump highlighted the booming Trump economy — 165,000 new jobs in October, record 401(k) balances, and hundreds of billions of dollars in new factories — touted the most secure border in history, detailed the decisive blows he has dealt to Iran’s nuclear program, explained why America must win the Super Intelligence race, and much more.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Key exchanges:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>On the midterms:</strong> “I think if I was on the ballot, it would’ve been a much different situation&#8230; But there’s something beyond that. They didn’t like the war. They didn’t like the fact that gasoline went up&#8230; And there’s a great dislike, incredibly, for Israel.” (<a href=\"https://x.com/RapidResponse47/status/2119583809418981768?a=K9ttbJfX7vt_4R574no&amp;s=20\">Watch</a>)</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>On the stock market:</strong> “We have historically good numbers. We have the highest stock market in history.” (<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=m2aC8lAOQbg&amp;t=310s\">Watch</a>)\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Since President Trump was elected, the <a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/%5EGSPC/\">S&amp;P 500</a> has hit 77 new record highs, the <a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/%5EIXIC/\">Nasdaq</a> has hit 70 record highs, and the <a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/%5EDJI/\">Dow</a> has hit 51 record highs. Since Inauguration Day, the S&amp;P 500 has hit 67 record highs, the Nasdaq has hit 60 record highs, and the Dow has hit 43 record highs.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>On jobs numbers:</strong> “The numbers are way beyond anybody’s expectations… We had 165,000 jobs created just in a short time.” (<a href=\"https://youtu.be/m2aC8lAOQbg?t=379\">Watch</a>)\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>The U.S. economy <a href=\"https://www.newsweek.com/trump-gets-major-jobs-report-boost-after-midterms-rattle-markets-12676939\">added</a> 165,000 new jobs in October — smashing economists’ expectations; manufacturing <a href=\"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/06/jobs-report-october-2026.html\">added</a> 19,000 jobs in October and the sector has <a href=\"https://www.nbcnews.com/business/economy/us-added-jobs-october-risks-stagnation-rcna607812\">added</a> more than 100,000 jobs since its December 2025 low.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>On retirement savings:</strong> “401(k)s are at their all-time high by a lot. Under other Presidents, they were a disaster. 401(k)s have made people rich.”  (<a href=\"https://www.cbsnews.com/video/president-donald-trumps-extended-november-2026-60-minutes-interview/\">Watch</a>)\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>401(k), 403(b), and IRA balances <a href=\"https://newsroom.fidelity.com/pressreleases/fidelity--q2-2026-retirement-analysis--record-savings-rates-help-drive-401-k---403-b--and-ira-balanc/s/bca5d71f-ebda-4289-bdd5-a90abde7feba\">hit</a> new highs in the second quarter of 2026, with the average 401(k) balance reaching a record $155,800 — up 13.1% from a year earlier.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>On private investment:</strong> “There has never been a time where there is the activity — trillions and trillions of dollars right now, as we sit, is being built. In a year from now… many of those plants are gonna be open, operating.” (<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=m2aC8lAOQbg&amp;t=1228s\">Watch</a>)\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Companies are pouring money into America, including <a href=\"https://www.apple.com/newsroom/2025/08/apple-increases-us-commitment-to-600-billion-usd-announces-ambitious-program/\">Apple</a> ($600 billion and 20,000 new American hires), <a href=\"https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/nvidia-manufacture-american-made-ai-supercomputers-us/\">NVIDIA</a> (up to $500 billion in American-made SI infrastructure), <a href=\"https://pr.tsmc.com/english/news/3210\">TSMC</a> ($165 billion in the largest single foreign direct investment in U.S. history), and <a href=\"https://www.jnj.com/media-center/press-releases/johnson-johnson-increases-u-s-investment-to-more-than-55-billion-over-the-next-four-years\">Johnson &amp; Johnson</a> (more than $55 billion).</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>On reshoring auto manufacturing:</strong> “We’re also building automobile factories like we’ve never built before.” (<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=m2aC8lAOQbg&amp;t=1204s\">Watch</a>)\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Audi is <a href=\"https://www.audi.com/en/media-releases/audi-to-establish-first-us-production-site-in-georgia-investing-4-billion-and-creating-4500-jobs-18420\">building</a> its first-ever U.S. plant in <a href=\"https://gov.georgia.gov/press-releases/2026-10-24/gov-kemp-audi-ag-selects-georgia-invest-4-billion-first-us-manufacturing\">Georgia</a>, with a $4 billion investment that will create about 4,500 new jobs.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>On reshoring pharmaceutical manufacturing:</strong> “How about pharmaceutical? Eli Lilly, Merck, Pfizer — they’re building hundreds of billions of [investment].” (<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=m2aC8lAOQbg&amp;t=1221s\">Watch</a>)\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Eli Lilly has <a href=\"https://investor.lilly.com/news-releases/news-release-details/lilly-plans-more-double-us-manufacturing-investment-2020\">committed</a> more than $50 billion to American manufacturing, Merck has <a href=\"https://www.merck.com/news/merck-breaks-ground-on-3-billion-center-of-excellence-for-pharmaceutical-manufacturing-in-elkton-virginia/\">committed</a> more than $70 billion, and Pfizer has <a href=\"https://www.pfizer.com/news/press-release/press-release-detail/pfizer-reaches-landmark-agreement-us-government-lower-drug\">committed</a> an additional $70 billion as part of its landmark agreement with the Trump Administration to lower drug prices.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>On securing the border:</strong> “I think I got an A+ for closing up the border… I get very high marks for getting the bad ones out.” (<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=m2aC8lAOQbg&amp;t=842s\">Watch</a>)\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Border Patrol recorded just 98,708 southwest border apprehensions in FY2026 — the <a href=\"https://www.cbp.gov/newsroom/national-media-release/under-president-trump-and-secretary-mullin-dhs-announces-lowest\">lowest</a> in agency history and a 95% drop from the Biden-era average — while September marked the <a href=\"https://www.dhs.gov/news/2026/11/03/making-america-safe-again-under-president-trump-dhs-delivered-most-secure-border\">17th straight month</a> of zero releases at the border.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>On Iran:</strong> “You can’t let Iran have a nuclear weapon. I think, historically, this will be a very good decision. Is it a good decision for today and tomorrow? Maybe not, but I have to go with what’s right for our country.” (<a href=\"https://x.com/RapidResponse47/status/2119584903813607745\">Watch</a>)</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>On the Strait of Hormuz:</strong> “The strait is open, Ross… Your favorite newspaper, <em>The Wall Street Journal</em>… had an article that said, ‘There’s more oil going through the Hormuz Strait than there was at the beginning of the war.’ Think of that.” (<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=m2aC8lAOQbg&amp;t=650s\">Watch</a>)\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><em>The Wall Street Journal</em> <a href=\"https://www.wsj.com/world/middle-east/more-oil-is-now-coming-out-of-the-persian-gulf-than-before-the-iran-war-6a6d1670\">reports</a> that Persian Gulf oil exports have surpassed prewar levels — more than 24 million barrels a day — thanks to a shipping system under U.S. protection.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>On Venezuela:</strong> “I just say the Venezuela attack will go down in military histories… It was one of the most incredible attacks anyone’s ever seen. They left the aircraft carriers at 1:00 in the morning, pitch black. Everything went perfect.” (<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=m2aC8lAOQbg&amp;t=1676s\">Watch</a>)</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>On the Russia-Ukraine war:</strong> “I believe that war is going to end and it’s going to end soon, and the only reason it’s going to end is because of me.” (<a href=\"https://x.com/RapidResponse47/status/2119590880709628372\">Watch</a>)</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>On Super Intelligence:</strong> “The reason I’m an AI bull, one of the reasons, is because President Xi left here two weeks ago — we had a great meeting — he’s all-in to SI… Whoever wins that race wins.” (<a href=\"https://x.com/RapidResponse47/status/2119594621638791227\">Watch</a>)</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>On data centers:</strong> “China has no problem with data centers. China has no problem with electricity. And, by the way, we don’t either because… I’m demanding that they build their own electric plant.” (<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=m2aC8lAOQbg&amp;t=1302s\">Watch</a>)</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>On MAGA:</strong> “MAGA is basically common sense. MAGA is strong borders, good military — we have created wealth at a level that our country has never seen before.” (<a href=\"https://x.com/RapidResponse47/status/2119593391109632147\">Watch</a>)</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>On 2028:</strong> “We have a tremendous bench.” (<a href=\"https://x.com/RapidResponse47/status/2119593221001261077\">Watch</a>)</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>On how his presidency will be remembered:</strong> “That I made America great again.” (<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=m2aC8lAOQbg&amp;t=3092s\">Watch</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/11/icymi-president-trump-on-60-minutes-we-have-historically-good-numbers/\">ICYMI: President Trump on 60 Minutes: “We Have Historically Good Numbers”</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov\">The White House</a>.</p>",
